<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Monsanto rated hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Monsanto rated hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Monsanto Co with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of 44. Shares rose 7/8 to 38-3/8.</p>
